{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "afb014543464f0ff522e0d4e0710d14a357510d78f2e102cd3419720880a3e1b", "ja": "だって、お姫さまだから", "zh": "因为是公主嘛", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "91d8db3f90d76e47fb0ce90040335d17e0b539a494addd1e5ff1f496c0ac72e2", "ja": "イベント成功を祝ってプチ打ち上げ中の5人\nに新しい仕事が。ついにこけら落とし公演に\n向けレッスンも本格化するが、お姫さまたち\nは胸を張って堂々と構えるのだった。\nバトンはTeam7thへ受け継がれ……！", "zh": "为庆祝活动成功，正在进行小型庆功会的5人中又有了新的工作。面向首场公演的课程终于也正式开始了，而公主们则挺起胸膛，堂堂正正地迎接挑战。接力棒传给了Team7th……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "8d86f1e1de78b2e73b8604a8b6703ffd6cf86ccab7225a859198114f9bfb1e88", "ja": "撮影会から数日後……", "zh": "摄影会结束几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "6a2aa043a45aadf118ce7d132b83f63c299b8b0ceeada47ed43d2a401c9a2e9f", "ja": "わんだほー！　5人のお姫さまとティーパーティー、\n大成功だったのです！", "zh": "太棒啦！和5位公主们的茶会大获成功哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "5c61a785e6f46f67a2c123faefc86099cb1f3becfcf87ab82dd52c64f60db312", "ja": "ここからは頑張ったお姫さま達のご褒美、取り置きの\nお菓子とお茶で、プチティーパーティーなのです♪", "zh": "接下来是给努力过的公主们的奖励，用特意留好的点心和茶，举办一场迷你茶会哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "31f367eb51145d73739df22f4b93d84f5ef58d44ba75bb7d4f303132ece5b867", "ja": "またパーティーなんて嬉しいネ！　本番でいっぱい\nダンスしたから、いっぱい食べちゃおうっと♪", "zh": "又有派对，真开心呀！因为正式演出跳了好多舞，所以要大吃一顿啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "c3042aea4c91c5b3bbc4752eebbd1149031de1f0cc6c2e7cf303640c2597f029", "ja": "あ、エミリー、足はもう平気？　パーティーのあとは\n生まれたての子鹿みたいにカクカクだったけど……？", "zh": "啊，艾米莉，你的腿已经没事了吗？派对结束后，你的腿还像刚出生的小鹿一样一颤一颤的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "2fd9b70111b57e892726dcffd3f667e89092fb6611d3c39b3c6b0fed0ea4c5c3", "ja": "は、はい。ひなたさんの、りんごとはちみつの生姜湯で\n温まったおかげで……うう、もっと精進いたします。", "zh": "是、是的。多亏喝了雏田小姐的苹果蜂蜜姜汤，身体暖和起来了……呜呜，我会更加精进的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "5a3e91f221ae0bdb6f73aa987882bb9b99cf5e95b6a0631a58c4353a9bc992d5", "ja": "でも、さすが、ひなたさんのおもてなし歓迎茶です。\n味も美味しくて、ごヒイキ様方にも大好評でしたね♪", "zh": "不过，不愧是日向小姐用来款待客人的迎宾茶呢。味道也很美味，各位贵客都赞不绝口呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "25dcf936a313e71d9efbc14df8a4c66dcc225c2df13f7839332c4a05eb1ef8b2", "ja": "エミリーちゃんの抹茶も美味しいねぇ。\n苦味がちょうどよくて、ほっとするべさ。", "zh": "艾米莉的抹茶也很好喝呢。\n苦味恰到好处，让人很放松。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "a50da0749642e179880e8b3454f697aaaa5ec853168dbe9064070d2c233c7f0d", "ja": "お茶請けのお菓子がマシュマロで、\n驚いたけども……不思議とよく合うんだねぇ。", "zh": "配茶的小点心居然是棉花糖，虽然让我吓了一跳……但不可思议地很搭呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "7676eafa02e124f0f5739bd3a6707a177bc786ca9e8af91ca513dd5ef9375142", "ja": "卵白と砂糖の柔らか菓子は、まつりさんが用意して\nくださったものですよね♪　お目が高いです！", "zh": "用蛋白和砂糖制成的柔软点心，是茉莉小姐准备的吧♪　您真有眼光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "0a1bc6243c949eace88a47a6054c6ef0251bec2b918aaea39331be75837f7755", "ja": "まつり姫御用達のお店の、限定マシュマロなのです。\n間違いはないのですよ♪", "zh": "这可是茉莉公主御用店家的限定棉花糖哦。\n绝对不会有错的呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "404a234d6850a61d036574a63eb308d8af25ffaf03b73e9045229dedb0922618", "ja": "へー、まつりってマシュマロ好きなんだ？\nそういえば、なんか似合ってるよ！", "zh": "诶～，原来小祭喜欢棉花糖啊？\n这么一想，还真觉得很适合你呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "7f55bfe60dc04ca4cbb37b162b2a4c82f8d81303dcee0e155bcb8535fa746226", "ja": "昴ちゃんはよくわかっているのです♪\n姫のマシュマロも食べていいのですよ？", "zh": "昴真懂姬的心思呢♪\n姬的棉花糖你也可以吃哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "a0fece4dd351b15beea97f74a56a9230d0387f5c25af7de9a134c025026fb797", "ja": "マジか、サンキュ！　にしても、みんなすげーよな。\nちゃんとカワイイお茶とかお菓子とか知っててさ。", "zh": "真的假的，谢谢！不过话说回来，大家真厉害啊。\n居然连可爱的茶和点心之类的都知道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "9b6c0e603b0a46dd714bd9fecf261874cb1f1cfaf96f3f603a636fcee4ec1c7d", "ja": "そういう昴ちゃんも、パーティーではとっても\nかわいくて、かっこよかったのです♪", "zh": "像昴亲那样，在派对上也非常可爱又帅气呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "347187a1d1a2214a793bbbfb6335747575c1c19370ff763de8bd9426dfc0516c", "ja": "ウンウン、スバルがボールを投げるたびに\nキャーって歓声があがってたネ♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，昴每次投球时，都会引起“呀——”的欢呼声呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "6f1df9896f5b61c35f60c10e391c5ed28fa10f69c040174435dc19a94fad5372", "ja": "そ、そうだっけ？　でもエレナのサンバも\nずーっと人だかりですごかったじゃん！", "zh": "是、是吗？不过艾蕾娜的桑巴也一直被人群围着，超厉害的吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "95a022451025850cb972dfc9b527d3a61939406f603d6d66cbb9957d6eb54210", "ja": "サンバにキャッチボール、野点にマシュマロ、\nりんごとはちみつの生姜湯……。", "zh": "桑巴、传接球、户外茶会、棉花糖，还有苹果蜂蜜姜汤……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "66872b6c861c30d53fd900d93a9af7e267a80cefd76fcb63b80bd9e4670b5b63", "ja": "思い返してみると、ちょっこしティーパーティーらしく\nなかったかもしれないねぇ。でも……。", "zh": "现在回想起来，可能确实稍微有点\n不太像茶会呢。不过……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "3e6fa2a959580178a3128c537ef6f94d2aabf79ca2f111eb8f77ffa2705b94b7", "ja": "はい、でも、とてもみなさんらしい……私たち六番隊\nらしい、楽しいおもてなしができたように思います♪", "zh": "是的，不过，我觉得我们似乎完成了一次非常有大家风格……也非常有我们六番队风格的愉快招待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1020_035hin", "source_sha256": "5a3326ead45686960b5696e60296f2156ddff67ad1e9daac5b2493f0225aae27", "ja": "うん。あたしたちなりのおもてなしができたのなら、\nよかったべさ！", "zh": "嗯。要是能以我们自己的方式好好款待了大家，\n那就太好了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1021_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "64d03a27710471b2069e1dd7815a720a4b7aac70a717eacb8c06bcfd52afc9b5", "ja": "お、いい匂いがすると思ったら……\n小さなお茶会だな。", "zh": "哦，我还想着是什么香味呢……\n原来是小小的茶会啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1023_021mat", "source_sha256": "b2c60e6d97a03a66093faa5443702139dfb7562e93762470a2aca223f89535e1", "ja": "お疲れさまなのです。ご褒美のプチティーパーティー\nなのですよ。プロデューサーさんもどうぞ、なのです♪", "zh": "辛苦啦。这是奖励的小茶会哦。制作人也请来吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "bb4035392c0f88e8c75f29bbe1445576a060e0f72b3361a0e81cd058bca63361", "ja": "じゃあ、お茶だけ少しもらおうかな。\nのんびりしたいけど、仕事の話があるから。", "zh": "那么，我就喝一点茶吧。\n虽然想悠闲一会儿，但还有工作上的事要谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1025_021mat", "source_sha256": "f47bc31fad47023c647a9dca6750ebf63aae02c3acf55cd5be4ce7d30d27256d", "ja": "？　お仕事のお話……？", "zh": "？工作上的事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "d70341f6ad03ccdcc931f14891c78d09a2145c286e40c105ed76a9cfce7c28d7", "ja": "Team6thにオファーが来た！\n新発売のお菓子のCMに、曲が採用されたんだ！", "zh": "Team6th接到了工作邀请！\n新发售的点心广告，选用了你们的歌曲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1027_021mat", "source_sha256": "3e6aa4fb6a5a9bcea8f679b1ac45aa4625e7884937be3fbbbbccb2cad5faa663", "ja": "ほ！？", "zh": "哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "bdc8927acb42407e6bacc9dc197b5e87affaa877cc58cffa21233fe7b26d4cc2", "ja": "ワオ！", "zh": "哇喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "656b7986d86202ede617415ee1afc8872f36e202b327e4810c9aec27beabe6b2", "ja": "マジで！？", "zh": "真的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1031_035hin", "source_sha256": "d233ff3d7c2f09661fe2a87454a2e9fd2f4d9d610027448bc2efba361accc17d", "ja": "わあ……！", "zh": "哇啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1032_401pro", "source_sha256": "4864da857c5e3f8f176eceb7a654e85bc5b5e179702d918004ba2fd594c9c65d", "ja": "今後、タイアップのイベント出演なんかも\nあるそうだ。みんな、おめでとう！", "zh": "听说今后还会有出演合作活动之类的机会。恭喜大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1033_401pro", "source_sha256": "d05aea2005985e6269fd6b7d607eb5de6a06f313df0374fd362187c36171f470", "ja": "ただ、劇場のこけら落とし公演に向けたレッスンも\nこれから本格化していくと思う。", "zh": "不过，为了剧场的首演，接下来的训练也会正式进入正轨。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0322_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0322_story_06_1034_401pro", "source_sha256": "182b311f80663e9717908a38c36ddb8f8bf9353ef094c2a169e15c2fc67898ec", "ja": "公演の準備と、新しい仕事。\n同時並行で忙しくなると思うけど……。", "zh": "演出的准备和新的工作。\n我想接下来会同时进行，变得忙碌起来吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
